WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.023 --> 00:00:07.928
Flopsy went outside.

2
00:00:07.929 --> 00:00:22.974
"Where are my sisters?" she said.

3
00:00:22.975 --> 00:00:27.933
Flopsy twitched her nose.

4
00:00:27.933 --> 00:00:34.706
"They went this way!" she said.

5
00:00:34.707 --> 00:00:39.099
She hopped along the path.

6
00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:42.253
Tommy Brock hurried back to his den.

7
00:00:42.254 --> 00:00:45.216
He was carrying Mopsy and Cotton-tail.

8
00:00:45.216 --> 00:00:52.028
"Rabbits!" Tommy thought happily.

9
00:00:52.028 --> 00:00:54.987
Tommy opened the oven door.

10
00:00:54.988 --> 00:01:01.143
He put the rabbits inside.

11
00:01:01.143 --> 00:01:05.037
"I'll eat dinner later,” he said.

12
00:01:05.038 --> 00:01:13.019
The two little bunnies started to cry.

13
00:01:13.020 --> 00:01:17.804
"I miss Mother and Flopsy," Cotton-tail said.

14
00:01:17.812 --> 00:01:21.377
"Me too," Mopsy said.

15
00:01:21.377 --> 00:01:31.885
"We’ll never see them again!"

16
00:01:31.886 --> 00:01:38.733
The badger looked for more food.

17
00:01:38.733 --> 00:01:41.789
He found some eggs.

18
00:01:41.790 --> 00:01:45.485
"I will eat these too," he said.

19
00:01:45.485 --> 00:01:49.133
Tommy yawned.

20
00:01:49.133 --> 00:02:05.897
"I'm tired after moving," he thought.

21
00:02:05.897 --> 00:02:08.796
"I will take a quick nap.

22
00:02:08.797 --> 00:02:11.988
Then I will eat my dinner."

23
00:02:11.988 --> 00:02:27.102
Flopsy hopped along the lane.

24
00:02:27.102 --> 00:02:31.993
Her nose twitched near a den.

25
00:02:31.993 --> 00:02:34.504
Then she heard a cry.

26
00:02:34.505 --> 00:02:40.220
"Mopsy?" Flopsy thought.

27
00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:44.156
Just then Flopsy saw something else.

28
00:02:44.157 --> 00:02:46.826
It was a red fox.

29
00:02:46.826 --> 00:02:49.985
"Uh-oh," Flopsy thought.

30
00:02:49.985 --> 00:02:55.873
She hid fast!

